<km-doc>
<km-title nodeId="ecb8d0ab08014bb78658077604265440">说明：管理类标签</km-title>
<km-catalog style="none" nodeId="c9611840a635459eb837c7a10f4e797d" />
<h1 align="start" nodeId="5da0ab8a3215405b8f7e069efb98d7c9"><span color="rgb(0, 0, 0)"><strong>一、背景</strong></span></h1>
<p align="start" nodeId="f48b6d8d3e9a45119450bb2a153a7670">随着风控规则、活动场景数量越来越多，维护成本日益增加，为解决上述问题，推出标签体系，为规则和活动场景分类。标签有多重分类维度，且分类维度有可能会新增，不同业务会有不同的分类维度，以反作弊为例，按公司业务分类：支付、早餐、外卖；按新人属性分类，如纯新客、品类新客、非新客等。总结下标签有如下作用：</p>
<ul nodeId="b27c9fab1e90454bb8f25d97a00a1baa">
<li nodeId="1c010df14d85410d80b9cd58b8b1c3cf">方便批量处理：出现参数异常，相关规则批量设置为不生效；新增活动场景，可按照标签批量添加规则</li>
</ul>
<ul nodeId="0a654b1483c04a1fa27831d8097fb239">
<li nodeId="3a9091addd1d4ece8a289e7ba8217238">查询、统计需求：提供查询接口用于统计分析</li>
</ul>
<p nodeId="e1b6448692454158bb1fd87b7eddfc7a" />
<h1 nodeId="c218139b66f94c8bb6f959fa908dd937">二、名词解释</h1>
<table responsive="false" nodeId="3d56a97c0df5484bad232962ae893253">
<tr nodeId="24221fe7c7474379b3191926d800830a">
<th colwidth="[96]" nodeId="32b3b1f86c30476787ba9a27aa573914">
<p nodeId="0d74044b145149ceb35d654c3aed7750">名词</p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[861]" nodeId="94a5804f2c984847b9b5cba96456de68">
<p nodeId="5a27f069598947958730dadc591faab0">解释</p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="fdedda41998e41e7acfc66af4254e70e">
<td colwidth="[96]" nodeId="ad97e7c50fee40fc9942af2905dad26e">
<p nodeId="724acba87e1e45278d895bd8a8f27b7d">管理类标签</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[861]" nodeId="7a5ab8ab1e434a729139ca49dbc7b799">
<p align="start" nodeId="7e529ef1b0064614b334661cfeca6528">管理类标签用于在平台管理规则、场景等实体。</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="534b4c32fa224456a6d5d6cf071d4264">
<td colwidth="[96]" nodeId="63d84f0a5f4d4e96a5d5b75cc10f5591">
<p nodeId="61174029ec5d4ece944f066a1fad06d2">风险标签</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[861]" nodeId="56f110a30c6744308df679646461d310">
<p nodeId="bfb2118f44464b02b06d4bde4ab19f03">风险标签仅能与规则绑定，有优先级属性，用于将规则本身携带的信息归类成体系。规则在命中后，会将这部分信息实时输出给调用方/下游。<a href="https://km.sankuai.com/collabpage/1357166907" title="https://km.sankuai.com/collabpage/1357166907" autoUpdate="true" nodeId="838cb5f696104c938df884a788aea902">https://km.sankuai.com/collabpage/1357166907</a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="873270e197e540c69d0e79e9884fdeb8">
<td colwidth="[96]" nodeId="0ee25fd5a7b84a73b53e4169f5a85e0a">
<p nodeId="b4323f136af4450694557b3990a08eb5">父标签</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[861]" nodeId="bae688f821a94d0ab3a598084f3c384d">
<p nodeId="1ae8449f835d4b79829c776fbc51d067">当前标签归属的上一级标签即为当前标签的父标签。</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="81f14fbe1f44422091d5f331641d9bd1">
<td colwidth="[96]" nodeId="7e5b690a6a7b47b28766a09031c70193">
<p nodeId="d7664c1b77f74adbb9dc9ab46bf044ac">标签层级</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[861]" nodeId="4f90a376d67e43ac89d80d4ce4b41869">
<p nodeId="ff82d2ad79d042ce8ccfb41504f6bcd9">目前支持最多形成6级关系。即用户可创建的最高标签层级为1级 ，最低为6级</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="d820ac4f506a4244b7074efa91c272be">
<td colwidth="[96]" nodeId="39d50084e99f4541ba837417f0cdb835">
<p nodeId="1f94ada0bbaf48edb87e081000dff182">根标签</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[861]" nodeId="0855c302ac3844c793b3000246e6cd1a">
<p nodeId="50f69b6f3f024728992ad2f2b93d2cd0">系统内置的0级标签，默认作为所有1级标签的父标签。</p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p nodeId="cb75d7d246004adb81835bef297fe940" />
<h1 nodeId="5ac4c8f6b81c4337957d409c6e90e2a3">三、操作说明</h1>
<h2 nodeId="ed74a443958a44b895ea69a62429d1ea">3.1 标签管理</h2>
