<h2 nodeId="c84f45f97d334dca9e4ef717209fb372">3.3  批量打标与批量删除</h2>
<table responsive="false" nodeId="10e601349042436ba25f14bd63043ac2">
<tr nodeId="3b763f8f2563484fa569b1ca71594ff8">
<th colwidth="[91]" nodeId="3f4cc0f873ee4dcbb182cc3a0fb8c299">
<p nodeId="f9d182ac4ff348a7b1276cefa9f259fe" />
</th>
<th colwidth="[516]" nodeId="472059a0c2ad4dcb9d72da50cc86bc38">
<p nodeId="be131e53bb994c2b988ca0a9328ebe2d">说明</p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[424]" nodeId="b9d0126a908e4f35a4aafb7b52f0844a">
<p nodeId="d745aba03a5248c982b0d65f50bd2d5c">示意图</p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="ce2dfe91038342638606c6139f1ffd10">
<td colwidth="[91]" nodeId="4fc9b8c9bf884d98a6d3e0b60dbd5f9c">
<p nodeId="6df94c0d28db432097ef5e964b7ad301">批量打标</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[516]" nodeId="85391baf592c49fa8feec00c247433fd">
<p nodeId="59fb67b332fd4210823e39aba66e31f4"><strong>功能描述</strong>：搜索定位<span color="rgb(0, 0, 0)">一批对象（规则、场景），选择一个期望配置的标签。给这批对象批量打标</span></p>
<p nodeId="b76a60b7f0a74623b939ba655f6ba862"><strong>入口：</strong>批量操作-批量打标签</p>
<p nodeId="8f00d18e27484455b71088bfe058aeeb"><strong>1.搜索要打标的对象</strong></p>
<p nodeId="5f7a9a128b4f49d9ae0a2f8037a332ff">对象类型：选择要打标签的对象<span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">（规则、场景），点击【查询】下方配置标签List会根据搜索条件展示所有搜到的对象。</span></p>
<km-note type="info" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="c0ee97986edd40739957fc93fea5abaa">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="27daafd4c2ac4e72b7bd64d462049c55">也可以选择按文件查询对象，准备txt文件，英文逗号隔开所有对象id。上传后，点击确认导入即可在下方list出现对象。示例：</p>
<km-attachment src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1357692026/142012472249?contentType=0" name="a.txt" size="28B" nodeId="c0bbaac0ba8d4eb7892535208cec76d3" />
<p nodeId="bf83e778fd074dcdb614f2bb143aa862">​</p>
</km-content>
</km-note>
<p nodeId="fedfd5f226824daeb8d6d2cde957d3f9"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)"><strong>2.批量配置标签</strong></span></p>
<p nodeId="c10417fadfb442ab884150372ac9b321"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">需要在此处选择，想要给这批对象打上什么标签。（对象为规则时，还需要选择打管理类还是风险标签）如图中，选择“zq测试2级”后，下方List中所有对象将要打上的标签都变为“zq测试2级”。</span></p>
<p nodeId="577a70840a2147c38a2e6adb09481e8d"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)"><strong>3.配置标签</strong></span></p>
<p nodeId="f35992d26e6243d19d3d560c7f67b683"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">此时可以针对其中具体的某条对象进行微调，下拉选择别的标签。</span></p>
<p nodeId="7ad7d027b6fd42c699768ddb5dec555d"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)"><strong>4.确认打标</strong></span></p>
<p nodeId="3c7a93a078854dd19147b6ea325d40f4"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">勾选最终需要确认打标的项目。</span></p>
<p nodeId="2a64192d08fb44358d29bb8f0b81601a"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">最后点击【确认打标】，将给勾选项目，打上所配置的标签。</span></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[424]" nodeId="bdca6ee5faf946d1b2d83686a1811a8b">
<p nodeId="9df1660b938d4963ad4acbfe116b2009"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1357692026/142018241562?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="368" height="184" nodeId="75a85eea21aa4b9ebcb19092d7a42e18" /></p>
<p nodeId="860917ffa40a4e71bb3350435918aa2d"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1357692026/142010553556?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="367" height="233" nodeId="313a30a81cf643c6a6036a7d50252820" /></p>
<p nodeId="3696a5eca3ff4a63b86911648390367d"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1357692026/142012151754?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="355" height="189" nodeId="4b397d77117a415fa750fc92abb3975e" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="5e39e96388604b8c91e0f837ef0dbddd">
<td colwidth="[91]" nodeId="b9dee66068954730a83cf3b0e80a2c11">
<p nodeId="4586ab58eb01471db4e16f44203a31de">批量删除</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[516]" nodeId="373c5a7b1113472ab6231e86e5c89bd8">
<p nodeId="4fe361730bd249f8ba149f096119060d"><strong>功能描述</strong>：<span color="rgb(0, 0, 0)">搜索定位一批具有一个共同标签的对象（规则、场景），将从对象中删除该标签。</span></p>
<p nodeId="769f9c8ddb3a4a38bece9ab7fd2f63a6"><strong>1.搜索要删除的对象标签</strong></p>
<p nodeId="865109b5ec6d426983b18fe4b622323e">对象类型：选择要删除标签的对象<span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">（规则、场景）</span></p>
<p nodeId="e5aa0364b08c486bb19303ae0294af8c"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)"><strong>2.配置标签</strong></span></p>
<p nodeId="dc3184b9fa104ffe9e8488079315184a"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">下方配置标签list中，可以勾选最终需要确认删除的标签。</span></p>
<p nodeId="844992ac789d44a1b49f99b3e4184590"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)"><strong>3.确认删除</strong></span></p>
